additionalConfig.description:
Additional Connect CA configuration in JSON format.
Please refer to [Vault Connect CA configuration](https://developer.hashicorp.com/consul/docs/secure-mesh/certificate/vault#configuration)
for all configuration options available for that provider.
Example:
```yaml
additionalConfig: |
{
"connect": [{
"ca_config": [{
"leaf_cert_ttl": "36h"
}]
}]
}
```

